  ],
  "solution": {
    "text": "<blockquote><p>Given: <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mfrac><mi>x</mi><mi>y</mi></mfrac></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>y</mi></mfenced></mrow></mfrac></math></p><p>And we know that, if <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mfrac><mi>x</mi><mi>y</mi></mfrac></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>y</mi></mfenced></mrow></mfrac></math> then <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mi>n</mi></msup></math>.</p><p>So, differentiating the function we get,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>f</mi><mo>'</mo></msup><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mi>n</mi><msup><mi>x</mi><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></math> and given <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>f</mi><mo>'</mo></msup><mfenced><mn>1</mn></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>2024</mn></math>.</p><p>Hence, on comparing we get, <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>n</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2024</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>⇒</mo><mi>x</mi><msup><mi>f</mi><mo>'</mo></msup><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>×</mo><mn>2024</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2023</mn></msup></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>⇒</mo><mi>x</mi><msup><mi>f</mi><mo>'</mo></msup><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>2024</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2024</mn></msup></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>⇒</mo><mi>x</mi><msup><mi>f</mi><mo>'</mo></msup><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>-</mo><mn>2024</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2024</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>⇒</mo><mi>x</mi><msup><mi>f</mi><mo>'</mo></msup><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>-</mo><mn>2024</mn><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p></blockquote>"
